Thought: First, I need to generate a dataset of nitride polymorphs. I'll start by getting data for common nitride compositions.
Action: batch_retrieve_polymorphs
Action Input: {"compositions": ["AlN", "GaN", "InN", "TiN", "ZrN", "HfN", "VN", "NbN", "TaN", "ScN", "YN", "LaN", "SiN", "GeN", "SnN"], "max_energy_above_hull": 0.3, "max_per_composition": 3, "save_directory": "nitrides_data"}

Thought: Now that I have the polymorph data for successful compositions, I need to consolidate them into a single dataset and prepare it for machine learning.
Action: consolidate_polymorph_datasets
Action Input: {"composition_files": {"AlN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/AlN_polymorphs.json", "GaN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/GaN_polymorphs.json", "InN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/InN_polymorphs.json", "TiN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/TiN_polymorphs.json", "ZrN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/ZrN_polymorphs.json", "HfN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/HfN_polymorphs.json", "VN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/VN_polymorphs.json", "NbN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/NbN_polymorphs.json", "TaN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/TaN_polymorphs.json", "ScN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/ScN_polymorphs.json", "YN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/YN_polymorphs.json", "LaN": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_data/LaN_polymorphs.json"}, "output_path": "consolidated_nitrides.json"}

Thought: Now I'll prepare the tabular dataset with advanced feature engineering and split it into training and test sets.
Action: prepare_tabular_dataset
Action Input: {"polymorphs_json_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/consolidated_nitrides.json", "output_path": "nitrides_dataset", "target_property": "formation_energy_per_atom", "feature_engineering": "advanced", "test_split": 0.2, "normalize": true}

Thought: Now I'll train the XGBoost model with the specified hyperparameters.
Action: train_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_dataset/train.csv", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_dataset/test.csv", "model_save_path": "xgboost_model.json", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Now I'll evaluate the model on the test set with detailed analysis and perform cross-validation.
Action: evaluate_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"model_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/xgboost_model.json", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_dataset/test.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "detailed_analysis": true}

Thought: Let me perform cross-validation to get additional validation metrics, since the detailed evaluation encountered an error.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_2/nitrides_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: I now have all the necessary results to create the final JSON output with the required metrics. From the training results and cross-validation, I'll compile the evaluation metrics into the specified format.
Action: write_file
Action Input: {"path": "model_evaluation_results.json", "content": {"test_set_evaluation": {"mae": 0.31999620447519117, "rmse": 0.3826037418549303, "r2": 0.6977938533434556, "feature_importance": {"density": 0.02183384820818901, "volume": 0.0027534051332622766, "nsites": 0.0009278291836380959, "band_gap": 0.020953472703695297, "energy_above_hull": 0.010316471569240093, "lattice_a": 0.04814266785979271, "lattice_b": 0.07095128297805786, "lattice_c": 0.06514713168144226, "lattice_alpha": 0.015300563536584377, "lattice_beta": 0.13593026995658875, "lattice_gamma": 0.05118107795715332, "lattice_volume": 0.010438528843224049, "num_species": 0.0, "packing_efficiency": 0.16668489575386047, "space_group_number": 0.04140596464276314, "crystal_system": 0.0004870244883932173, "num_elements": 0.0, "electronegativity_diff": 0.33754557371139526}}, "cross_validation_results": {"r2_mean": 0.6096667432496028, "r2_std": 0.2801696472479279}}}
